    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d569">

                <pb facs="0697" n="687" sameAs="frus:frus1948v07/pg687"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.03/12–2648: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Stuart</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Nanking</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1948-12-26T13:00:00+08:00">December 26,
                            1948—1 p. m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received 11:35 p. m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>2622. Tung Kuan-hsien, former North China CNRRA<anchor n="71" xml:id="d569-f1"/>
                    head, elected new President Legislative Yuan December 24. Liu Chien-chun, former
                    Youth Corps officer, also previously connected with Tai Li,<anchor n="72"
                        xml:id="d569-f2"/> elected Vice President.</p>
                <p>Tung’s election a direct rebuff to Generalissimo, as he was supported by
                    coalition consisting of youth corps, Wu Tieh-cheng group, Li Tsung-jen group and
                    independents against Li Pei-chi, who was hand-picked by Generalissimo, nominated
                    by Central Political Council, and supported only by CC group. CC clique suffered
                    another blow in vice presidential election when their candidate Cheng
                        Tien-fang<anchor n="73" xml:id="d569-f3"/> was defeated by same
                    coalition.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Stuart</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d569-f1" n="71" xml:id="d569-f1-content">
                <p>Chinese National Relief and Rehabilitation Administration.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d569-f2" n="72" xml:id="d569-f2-content">
                <p>Former Deputy Director of the Bureau of Investigations and Statistics (Chinese
                    secret police organization).</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d569-f3" n="73" xml:id="d569-f3-content">
                <p>Member of the Chinese Legislative Yuan.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
